OL,3,CGardai 'told not to pursue wrong-way
OL,4,Cdriver' before fatal crash
OL,6,FGardai were told not to engage with a
OL,7,Fstolen vehicle travelling the wrong
OL,8,Fway down a motorway before a horror
OL,9,Ffatal head-on crash with another car,
OL,10,Fa representative organisation has said.
OL,12,FFive teenagers, all occupants of one
OL,13,Fof the vehicles, died and four people
OL,14,Fwere seriously injured in the crash on
OL,15,Fthe M9 motorway in Co Kildare in the
OL,16,Fearly hours of Sunday morning.
OL,18,FOne of those seriously injured is a
OL,19,Fchild.
OL,26,@kD@FrtnD@Frt
