PN,41102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786967345
OL,3,CGardai 'told not to pursue wrong-way
OL,4,Cdriver' before fatal crash
OL,6,FThe Garda Representative Association
OL,7,F(GRA) said its members were "all in
OL,8,Fshock" after the "horrific incident".
OL,10,FGRA vice-president John Joe O'Connell
OL,11,Fsaid on Monday: "This involved a
OL,12,Fstolen BMW that drove ` trying to
OL,13,Fevade gardai ` drove the wrong way
OL,14,Fdown the M9 and then a head-on
OL,15,Fcollision occurred with this car of a
OL,16,Ffamily heading to Dublin Airport on
OL,17,Fholidays for a few days."
OL,26,@kD@FrtoD@]OUpD@FO]pD@ROUpD@dO]sD@QOUuD@
OL,26,ALrtyD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786967345
OL,3,CGardai 'told not to pursue wrong-way
OL,4,Cdriver' before fatal crash
OL,6,FMr O'Connell said the BMW had earlier
OL,7,Ffailed to stop for gardai and that it
OL,8,Fwas his understanding that an
OL,9,Finstruction was given not to engage
OL,10,Fwith the vehicle as it travelled the
OL,11,Fwrong way down the M9.
OL,13,FAsked if this was standard procedure,
OL,14,Fhe told RTE's Morning Ireland radio
OL,15,Fprogramme: "It would be standard
OL,16,Fpractice, and the command and control
OL,17,Fcentre would be dictating what happens
OL,18,Fin a live environment ` but the
OL,19,Fmembers in the cars have to make a
OL,20,Fsplit-second decision."
OL,26,@kD@FrtoD@YrtvD@KrbwD@LOU|D@WO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
