PN,41104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786967345
OL,3,CGardai 'told not to pursue wrong-way
OL,4,Cdriver' before fatal crash
OL,6,FMr O'Connell said there were "numerous
OL,7,Fgangs" of boys and young men "trying
OL,8,Fto outdo each other" in social media
OL,9,Fvideos depicting interactions with
OL,10,FGardai, pursuits and wrong-way driving.
OL,12,F"Our members are not going to follow
OL,13,Fdown that route ` we're damned if you
OL,14,Fdo and damned if you don't, that way."
OL,26,@kD@FrtnD@^OUoD@FO]oD@^OUpD@TO]rD@FrttD@
OL,26,AAOUvD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,412,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786967345
OL,3,CGardai 'told not to pursue wrong-way
OL,4,Cdriver' before fatal crash
OL,6,FThe Kildare-based representative said
OL,7,Fthe GRA did not "know what the exact
OL,8,Fanswer is" to address the problem, but
OL,9,Fadded: "There's not one member of An
OL,10,FGarda Siochana trained in pursuit `
OL,11,Fnever mind in dealing with cars going
OL,12,Fdown the wrong way."
OL,14,FMr O'Connell said gardai also face
OL,15,Finternal sanctions, discipline and
OL,16,Fpossible criminal offences when they
OL,17,Fdecide to engage in pursuits.
OL,19,FHe said garda cars have also been
OL,20,Frammed by stolen vehicles.
OL,26,@kD@FrtoD@QOUpD@JO]qD@HOUrD@HrtrD@LrptD@
OL,26,ATO]vD@Xrt
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/8
