PN,41106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F411A1786967345
OL,3,CGardai 'told not to pursue wrong-way
OL,4,Cdriver' before fatal crash
OL,6,FMr O'Connell said there was a need to
OL,7,F"look at the sentences" when these
OL,8,Fcases come before the courts, as he
OL,9,Fcriticised those partaking in wrong-
OL,10,Fway driving as "playing Russian
OL,11,Froulette with their lives and everyone
OL,12,Felse's lives".
OL,14,FHe urged parents to talk to their sons
OL,15,Fabout the potential consequences if
OL,16,Fthey get into a stolen car "for the
OL,17,Fcraic and the clicks".
OL,26,@kD@FrtoD@AOUoD@WO]rD@POUtD@MO]xD@\OUyD@
