OL,3,CGardai 'told not to pursue wrong-way
OL,4,Cdriver' before fatal crash
OL,6,FGarda Commissioner Justin Kelly has
OL,7,Fdescribed the head-on collision
OL,8,Fbetween junctions 3 and 4 as
OL,9,F"horrific" and warned that "in some
OL,10,Fcases" vehicles are being driven on
OL,11,Fthe wrong side of motorways for social
OL,12,Fmedia likes.
OL,14,FThe previous weekend, nine people were
OL,15,Finjured in a head-on collision on the
OL,16,FM50 in Dublin with a car travelling in
OL,17,Fthe wrong direction on the motorway.
OL,19,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,20,FITVX
